sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Operator / SOC
    participant CLI as Cobra CLI (main.go)
    participant TUI as Bubble Tea TUI (internal/ui)
    participant Guardcat as Guardcat Watchdog (internal/guardcat)
    participant Vault as Live Vault Pool (internal/vault)
    participant Runner as Concurrent Runner (internal/runner)
    participant Dialer as Protocol Stack (DoH/DoT/Standard)

    User->>CLI: idt (Launch Command Center)
    CLI->>TUI: Initialize Bubble Tea Model & Theme
    TUI->>Guardcat: EnsureReadiness & CheckInternetConnectivity
    Guardcat-->>TUI: Preflight OK / Network Status Verified
    TUI->>Vault: Warmup Candidates & Baseline Oracle
    Vault->>Dialer: Probe Seed Resolvers (UDP/TCP Port 53 & DoH)
    Dialer-->>Vault: Return Validated Live Resolvers & RTT
    Vault-->>TUI: Live Resolver Pool Ready (Min 3 Nodes)
    
    User->>TUI: Select "Run Internet Dialer Test (IDT)"
    TUI->>Runner: Run(ctx, dialers, options)
    
    loop Concurrent Dials (MaxConcurrent = 3)
        Runner->>Dialer: Dial(ctx, target) with DPI Frag & TCP_NODELAY
        Dialer-->>Runner: Return Answer (RTT, IPs, EOF/Err status)
        alt EOF or Connection Reset Detected
            Runner->>Guardcat: RecordFailure / Check EOF Thresholds
            Guardcat-->>Runner: Trigger Auto-Reconnect if Window Breached
        else Successful Dial
            Runner->>Guardcat: RecordSuccess
        end
    end

    Runner-->>TUI: Return Aggregated Results & Verdicts
    TUI->>TUI: Sort by Median Latency & Compute Comparison
    TUI-->>User: Render Elite RTT Distribution & Telemetry Dashboard
